---
description: Constraints for a UI-only playground.
globs: src/components/**/*.tsx, src/app/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: true
---

# UI Playground Rules

- **No Backend:** Do not use `async` server components for data fetching. Use static `const MOCK_DATA`.
- **Imports:** Always use the `@/` alias (e.g., `@/components/ui/button`).
- **Structure:**
  - Primitives: `src/components/ui`
  - Custom Blocks: `src/components/blocks` (create this folder if it doesn't exist)
